{"version":1,"content":"<p>名媛林恬兒（Emily）與何柱國兒子何正德結婚近12年，惜終不敵時間離婚收場。</p><p>林恬兒同JW（王灝兒）舊愛葉韋彤（Tarzan）慶生親密合照早前遭盜用流出，林恬兒與何正德隔空發聲明交鋒。</p><p>近日，林恬兒更將社交網帳戶名稱由原本「emilylam.</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:21:50.233537+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T05:12:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.817804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.817804+00:00","content_hash":"fe083f5786d598cfb24a605532ace59ee33c0b0fe8aa2f35f0149f3303d9f570","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}